<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia retail sales rose 2.4 pct in July.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia retail sales rose 2.4 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian retail sales rose 2.4 percent to A$10.44 billion in July, seasonally adjusted, after rising 0.1 percent to A$10.20 billion in June, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>In July 1995, retail sales rose 0.9 percent to A$9.810 billion.</p>
<p>Analysts had expected retail sales to rise an average 0.4 percent in July.</p>
</text>
